# Never let a local .env leak into the build context — VITE_API_URL is
# injected explicitly via the Dockerfile's ARG/ENV instead (see its own
# comment). Confirmed a real env var already wins over any .env file's
# value, but excluding these too removes any ambiguity, and guarantees a
# developer's local-only value (e.g. localhost) can never end up in a
# built image by accident. .env.example has no secrets but also nothing
# the build needs — no reason for it to be in the image either.
.env
.env.*

*.log
.DS_Store
